sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant PA as PlayerActivity
    participant MO as MaxiOverlayFragment
    participant MK as MediaKindPlayer
    participant Seek as subscribeSeekChangeObservable

    Note over User,Seek: Post-reload channel zap (e.g. ch 55 E48 → ch 56)

    User->>PA: Channel Up/Down (zap)
    PA->>MO: clearMapOfShortCut()
    MO->>MO: removeAllViews() — shortcut layout emptied
    PA->>PA: initPlayer() — resetPlayerStateFlags()
    Note over PA: isHeaderUiPreUpdated = true<br/>header pre-updated during zap

    MK-->>PA: onPlaybackStarted()
    PA->>Seek: subscribe #1 (onPlaybackStarted)
    Note over PA: needToUpdateUI = restartedAfterPause == false<br/>may be true after initPlayer

    MK-->>PA: onBufferStopped()
    PA->>Seek: subscribe #2 (onBufferStopped)
    Note over Seek: dispose #1 — onPlaybackStarted subscription cancelled

    alt Race: onBufferStopped wins (post-reload / slow seek)
        Seek-->>PA: doAfterFirst → setPlayer(needToUpdateUI=false)
        PA->>MO: handlePlayerControlPlay(needToUpdateUI=false)
        Note over MO: setShortcutMenu() SKIPPED<br/>shortcutMenuLayout still empty
        User->>PA: OK / open overlay
        PA->>MO: showNonBufferContents()
        Note over MO: layout visible but no ShortcutMenuItem children
    else Race: onPlaybackStarted wins (first zap / fast seek)
        Seek-->>PA: doAfterFirst → setPlayer(needToUpdateUI=true)
        PA->>MO: handlePlayerControlPlay(needToUpdateUI=true)
        MO->>MO: setShortcutMenu() + setVisibilityForEachShortCut()
        Note over MO: shortcuts rebuilt correctly
        MK-->>PA: onBufferStopped()
        PA->>Seek: subscribe #2
        Seek-->>PA: setPlayer(needToUpdateUI=false)
        Note over MO: shortcuts already built — OK
    end
